# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# prefs: factory
# setup: idebuild
# A build's complaint shown where it is: the compiler names a line and a
# column, and the page underlines the name there and shows the words under
# the line.
wait 25
click 980 30
wait 4
menu-pick Programming
wait 4
menu-pick TikuBasic
wait 150
expect-title Project
click 71 8
wait 8
menu-pick Open Project…
wait 40
expect-title Open
click 400 220
wait 6
click 675 413
wait 60
expect-no-title Open
click-window Project
wait 8
click 71 8
wait 8
expect-menu Build for host
menu-pick Build for host
wait 200
expect-title Messages
click 71 8
wait 8
expect-menu Go to line 4
menu-pick Go to line 4
wait 120
expect-title bad.c
shot /tmp/tiku-ide-problems.png
note the name the compiler pointed at is underlined: the error's wavy
note red line, whose rises and falls alternate every 2 pixels, and under
note it the note's straight blue one, both ending with the name
expect-pixel 238 381 cb3030
expect-pixel 240 381 ffffff
expect-pixel 238 382 286ec8
expect-pixel 300 381 ffffff
note and what the compiler said is shown under the line, the error on
note a red band and the note on a blue one
expect-pixel 700 390 e59797
expect-pixel 760 401 93b6e3
quit
